IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHDECODE-V6.

DATA DIVISION.
01 BATCH-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TREE-DEPTH          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BRANCH-FACTOR       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHDECODE-V6.
    IF BATCH-SIZE == 0 OR TREE-DEPTH == 0 OR BRANCH-FACTOR == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 23400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 BATCH-SIZE.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
